  }}
>
  <article class="relative overflow-hidden">
    <ArticleHeader kicker={"Brand Review"} badge={"Label-Checked"} author={author} dates={dates} mobileAd={false}>
      <Fragment slot="title">Designer Whey Protein Powder Review</Fragment>
      Designer Whey has been on supermarket shelves since the 1990s and is now sold by Designer Wellness. Here is what the current label actually contains, whether it is tested, how lactose-friendly it is, and what each 25 g of protein costs.
    </ArticleHeader>

    <TableOfContents>
