            Designer Whey is a light, stevia-sweetened supermarket whey with 20 g of protein, 110 calories, fiber and probiotics per scoop, and at $1.91 per 25 g in the 4 lb tub it is fairly priced. It is not pure whey, since the blend includes micellar casein, it is not lactose free, and it carries no third-party certification.
          </p>
